{
  "_comment": [
    "Environment adapter: the Object Impact Framework rule packs by kuroishitam and friends. Each pack",
    "defines its own keyword and gives it to spells by name through a KID ini (*Fire, *Frost ...); its OIF",
    "rules then ask weaponsKeywords for it. A spell whose name has no element word gets nothing, and the",
    "packs read the spell record (docs/librarian/PERK_ADAPTERS.md 6-5). These lines give the pack keyword",
    "to the spell's damage effects with the \"damage\" planner, like env-elements.json (fire, frost and shock",
    "by the effect's own resistance; water and air, which have none, by a visible effect with no element",
    "resistance in a water or air spell):",
    "  fire                 - the fire keywords (light torches, melt ice, burn hay, books, insects ...)",
    "  frost, water and air - the dousing keywords (waterbearing*: put out torches, fires, sconces)",
    "  frost only           - coldbearingtts (Turn The Salt), CnC_Frost (Cast and Cook)",
    "  shock                - electricbearingtts, WCEspell (Water Conduct Electricity), STOzap (Switch Them On)",
    "DEPENDS ON THE GAME: OIF calls HasKeyword on the spell (attackSource). CommonLib's MagicItem overrides",
    "BGSKeywordForm::HasKeyword, which points at the spell answering for its effects' keywords too; a keyword",
    "this file puts on an effect then reaches the rule. Not confirmed in game yet - the in-game self-test",
    "checks it. If it does not hold, these lines need a spell-record target.",
    "keywordForm ids read from each pack's ESP (all ESL-flagged). firebearingnf (Dynamic Fire Sconce's NFDR",
    "patch) and fireidf (its Fires Off patch) are defined in none of the pack plugins we have: EditorID only.",
    "Off with config.json \"environment\": { \"enabled\": false }. Nothing is taken off: a keyword KID gave",
    "by name stays where it is."
  ],
  "perkMod": "OIF rule packs (Dynamic Torches NG, Melt The Ice, Flammable Alcohol, Turn The Salt, Fires Off, Dynamic Fire Sconce, Burn The Hay, Burn Those Insects, Burn Those Books, Build A Campfire, Cooking with Fire, Cast and Cook, Water Conduct Electricity, Switch Them On)",
  "measured": "2026-10-20",
  "requires": {
    "config": "environment.enabled",
    "any": ["Dynamic Torch NG.esp", "Melt The Ice.esp", "Flammable Alcohol.esp", "Turn The Salt.esp",
      "Fires Off.esp", "DFS.esp", "BTH.esp", "Burn Those Insects.esp", "Burn Those Books.esp", "BACF.esp",
      "Cooking with Fire.esp", "Cast and Cook.esp", "waterconductelectricity.esp", "STO.esp"]
  },
  "adapters": [
    { "keyword": "firebearingdt", "keywordForm": "Dynamic Torch NG.esp|0x000805", "why": "Dynamic Torches NG: light torches",
      "damage": { "elements": ["fire"],
        "keywordsNone": ["APO_MagicDamageUnspecified", "DAR_UnspecificMagicDamage"] }, "tierMin": "manual" },
    { "keyword": "firebearingm", "keywordForm": "Melt The Ice.esp|0x000899", "why": "Melt The Ice",
      "damage": { "elements": ["fire"],
        "keywordsNone": ["APO_MagicDamageUnspecified", "DAR_UnspecificMagicDamage"] }, "tierMin": "manual" },
    { "keyword": "firebearingf", "keywordForm": "Flammable Alcohol.esp|0x000803", "why": "Flammable Alcohol",
      "damage": { "elements": ["fire"],
        "keywordsNone": ["APO_MagicDamageUnspecified", "DAR_UnspecificMagicDamage"] }, "tierMin": "manual" },
    { "keyword": "firebearingtts", "keywordForm": "Turn The Salt.esp|0x000800", "why": "Turn The Salt: fire",
      "damage": { "elements": ["fire"],
        "keywordsNone": ["APO_MagicDamageUnspecified", "DAR_UnspecificMagicDamage"] }, "tierMin": "manual" },
